INDEMNIFICATION, ESCROW AND HOLDBACK RELEASE DEED

M&A Transaction Holdback Facility | Escrow Account No. 8940-1920-410 | Governed by Delaware Law

<table border="1"><tr><td>This Escrow and Indemnification Release Agreement('Release') is dated as of December 05,2024, among BLUESTAR THERAPEUTICS INC.('Buyer'),GENOMIC BIOLABS CORP.('Seller Representative'),and JPMORGAN CHASE BANK,NATIONAL ASSOCIATION,as Escrow Agent('Escrow Agent')。
</td></tr><tr><td>WHEREAS, pursuant to the Agreement and Plan of Merger dated December 15,2023,Buyer deposited an aggregate indemnity holdback amount of USD15,000,000.00('Escrow Fund') into segregated escrow;
WHEREAS,Buyer submitted formal Notice of Indemnification Claim Ref. CL-2024-04 alleging breach of Section 3.14(Tax Representations) in the liquidated amount of USD2,450,120.00;
NOW THEREFORE,in compromise of said dispute,the parties hereby issue joint written instructions to Escrow Agent to release funds as follows:
1. DISBURSEMENT TO BUYER: Escrow Agent shall disburse the sum of USD1,850,000.00 by Fedwire to Buyer&#x27;s designated operating account,in full and final settlement of Claim CL-2024-04;
2. RELEASE TO SELLERS: Escrow Agent shall distribute the remaining balance of USD13,150,000.00,together with accrued interest of USD314,920.18,pro rata to the former equityholders listed on Exhibit A;
3. MUTUAL RELEASE: Buyer and Seller Representative unconditionally release and discharge each other and their respective affiliates from all further liability under Article VIII of the Merger Agreement。</td></tr></table>

Joint written direction executed by Buyer, Seller Representative, and acknowledged by Escrow Officer: Sarah L. Jenkins, VP Commercial Escrow
